# Design system

## Theme

- **Light and dark** via CSS variables in `globals.css` (`:root` / `.dark`); toggle in `SiteNav`
- Accent: sky (`--accent`); avoid purple-on-black “AI slop” gradients
- Borders: `border-border`; surfaces: `var(--card-muted)` or subtle gradients on project cards only

## Typography

- One sans stack (Geist via layout); uppercase micro-labels with `tracking-[0.2em]` for section titles
- Hero: large semibold title; body max-width ~`max-w-2xl` for readability

## Layout patterns

- **Motion page:** vertical narrative — hero → about → experience → education → side projects → skills → know me → footer
- **Bento pattern (archive):** 12-column grid, `rounded-3xl` cards, varied `col-span`
- Section ids used by nav: `about`, `experience`, `education`, `projects`, `skills`, `know-me`

## Motion & a11y

- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: disable GSAP/Framer entrance animations when set
- No ENTER splash gates (bad SEO/a11y)
- Keep animation **subtle** — no full-page WebGL/Three.js unless explicitly requested
- GSAP: use `gsap.context` + cleanup in `useEffect`; register ScrollTrigger once per client module

## Components

- Shared chrome: `SiteNav`, `SiteFooter`, `ContactEmail` in `components/shared/`
- Section blocks: `components/shared/sections.tsx` — reuse before forking layouts
